          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अभिषेकः — abhiṣekaḥ — \"a coronation; an anointing\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अद्य प्रासादे अभिषेकः भवति। adya prāsāde abhiṣekaḥ bhavati. Today there is a coronation in the palace."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अभिषेकः (abhiṣekaḥ) is built from abhi and the root √sic, \"to sprinkle\"; MW gives abhiṣeka as anointing or consecrating by sprinkling water, and the inauguration of a king (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
